OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 26 JUL
OL,4,CEVENTS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1997FAlan Towers - long-running
OL,7,Fpresenter of BBC Midlands Today,
OL,8,Fresigns live on air at the end of a
OL,9,FSaturday bulletin, with a criticism of
OL,10,FBBC management:
OL,11,
OL,12,F"For me, this is a personal goodbye now
OL,13,Fbecause I am leaving the BBC after 25
OL,14,Fyears. When I joined the corporation,
OL,15,Fit was led by giants. Now I'm afraid,
OL,16,Fit's led by pygmies in grey suits,
OL,17,Fwearing blindfolds. How sad. But, times
OL,18,Fdo change. From me now, for the final
OL,19,Ftime, goodbye".
OL,20,
OL,21,
OL,22,
